      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stepney%2C_Connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In the early 19th century, Stepney became a transportation hub as travelers followed the first paved Bridgeport and Newtown Turnpike and Hattertown Road.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
